      },
      {
        "text": "Loving the people requires knowing them, spending time with them, and listening to them.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Folks are currently struggling due to rising costs after the pandemic.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There are approximately 600,000 Georgians in the healthcare coverage gap.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
